 New Wave in the 1960s.\nAfter moving to the United States, he became professor of film direction at the American Film Institute in Beverly Hills. His personal life as well as his films encompassed and spanned a range of cultures: Jewish, Slovak, Hungarian, Czech, and American.", "biography_author": "Wikidata", "date_of_biography": "2022-05-19T11:53:27.632946+10:00", "external_links": [{"id": 2327, "uri": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/J%C3%A1n_Kad%C3%A1r"}], "uuid": "992d8779-4c9e-4314-94bb-a106674b7957", "source": {"name": "Vernon", "slug": "vernon"}, "source_identifier": null, "external_references": [{"id": 9978, "source": {"name": "Wikidata", "slug": "wikidata"}, "source_identifier": "Q715455"}, {"id": 9979, "source": {"name": "VIAF", "slug": "viaf"}, "source_identifier": "57490293"}, {"id": 9980, "source": {"name": "LOC Auth", "slug": "loc-auth"}, "source_identifier": "n80015886"}, {"id": 9981, "source": {"name": "WorldCat", "slug": "worldcat"}, "source_identifier": "lccn-n80015886"}], "date_modified": "2023-06-14T16:33:30.576250+10:00"}, {"id": 78284, "name": "Mick Connolly", "roles_in_work": [{"id": 2128604, "title": "Cabbie of the year", "work_id": 86490, "role": "director", "role_id": 938, "is_primary": true}], "also_known_as": "", "date_of_birth": "", "date_of_death": "", "places_of_operation": [], "biography": "", "biography_author": null, "date_of_biography": "2023-05-09T13:15:30.869754+10:00", "external_links": [], "uuid": "42349da5-a024-4206-a57e-854b6b51898b", "source": {"name": "Vernon", "slug": "vernon"}, "source_identifier": "25319", "external_references": [], "date_modified": "2023-06-14T16:33:30.576250+10:00"}, {"id": 78283, "name": "Scottie Connolly", "roles_in_work": [{"id": 2128599, "title": "Cabbie of the year", "work_id": 86490, "role": "producer", "role_id": 1089, "is_primary": true}], "also_known_as": "", "date_of_birth": "", "date_of_death": "", "places_of_operation": [], "biography": "", "biography_author": null, "date_of_biography": "20